[SPEAKER_03]: He was 77 years old.

32
00:04:44,485 --> 00:04:54,709
[SPEAKER_03]: Now, therefore, be it resolved by the Medford City Council that we share our deepest condolences with Mr. Westwater's family and loved ones and express our hope that this senseless tragedy will not be in vain and will not be repeated.

33
00:04:55,070 --> 00:04:57,971
[SPEAKER_03]: Be it further resolved that we will work with the MBTA and Amtrak

34
