1702
02:28:59,751 --> 02:29:02,331
[SPEAKER_19]: Medford is required by law to have a city solicitor.

1703
02:29:03,032 --> 02:29:04,392
[SPEAKER_19]: Look at our city's ordinances.

1704
02:29:04,632 --> 02:29:11,094
[SPEAKER_19]: Article 4, sections 2-651 through 2-657 say so explicitly.

1705
02:29:12,075 --> 02:29:15,976
[SPEAKER_19]: One of those says, quote, there shall be a city solicitor, unquote.

1706
02:29:16,983 --> 02:29:20,487
