1709
02:29:36,241 --> 02:29:36,601
[SPEAKER_19]: Unquote.

1710
02:29:37,362 --> 02:29:38,403
[SPEAKER_19]: None of this is optional.

1711
02:29:38,823 --> 02:29:45,729
